  (text
    "CONTROLLER CANDIDATE / ROUTING AND FULLSYSTEM ERC REQUIRED\nU201 all48physicalpins verified againstST DS10690 Rev7 Figure8/Table15.\n4.2MHz MSI range6; VOSRange3; Flash0WS. PH0/PH1 areNC.\nSafety sheet ownsRESETpullup/1kseries, ARM/STOP/WDI defaultpulls.\nADC18/19 connect throughR220/R221; MCU pin20 PB2 is digital only."
    (at 35.56 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid ad16a730-e950-55d4-b185-0ca8553bf925))
  (text
    "LCD: twelve33ohm source resistors; preserve PA8STOP/PA9WDI while writingPA0..7.\nJ20120way hinge: paired FH12 bottomcontacts, TypeD opposite-side ultra-flex203mm.\nBothconnector mouths pointtowardrear+Y; both native180deg socketrotations put pin1 atdock+X in closedpose.\nCable routing/twist/continuity, signal integrity and hinge life remain unqualified."
    (at 165.1 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 859965d0-e7ee-5e5f-823a-a6754cd42340))
  (text
    "MONITORS: UVmoduleownsFB10k/100nF andVOUT1M/68k+10k/100nF.\nADS1115directinputs,0x48; no duplicatefilters. NTC10k0.1% pullups toVDDArail,\nVishay10k B3435 sensorstoGND;1k/100nF atADC8/9.\nUVVBUS divider100k/150k ratio0.6→PB2 digital; noADC onPB2.\nCurrent, settling, USB suspend/inrush and powered faults require hardware trials."
    (at 35.56 410.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6c988b87-b3f5-58ef-8e19-5f94bcada1db))
